{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/742875-beast-seeking-a-game","id":742875,"title":"Beast - Seeking a game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-30T14:27:32-07:00","id":742875,"title":"Beast - Seeking a game","content":"So! With the Beast backer PDF out, are there other backers out there looking to play a game? (And one willing to run? ^^ )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-30T16:36:21-07:00","id":743211,"title":"","content":"I would be down to play in a game. Nowhere near confident enough with Beast to run a game yet, though. Are you looking for a game that is exclusively Beast, or a game that is open to other character types?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-31T02:23:59-07:00","id":744014,"title":"","content":"I can go either way. Crossover can be a challenge for a ST though. Because of the different styles for splats, a ST who runs one may not be content with another.<br /> <br /> For example, I run a werewolf game elsewhere, but I'm not as confident with running other types of games. (Though I am brushing up for a Neolithic game I'm planning to run in a couple of months)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T08:35:38-08:00","id":746682,"title":"","content":"Do you have to be a backer to play? I have the free Kickstarter Preview they gave out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/480-blind-dragon","name":"Blind Dragon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T10:35:41-08:00","id":747019,"title":"","content":"I would have said that pdf was fine, but I don't know how much has changed between that and the finished pdf.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T10:22:30-08:00","id":756717,"title":"","content":"I'd be up for playing, been going through the backer PDF and looking forward to using it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9094-kilnard","name":"Kilnard","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-05T13:45:12-08:00","id":757193,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blind Dragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/742875-beast-seeking-a-game?p=746682#post746682\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you have to be a backer to play? I have the free Kickstarter Preview they gave out.</div> </div> </div> </div>There are mechanical changes between the kickstarter preview and the backer pdf. For example, the birthright powers for Makara, Namtaru, and Ugallu have all changed from what they are in the preview. The 'You Are Meat' nightmare is gone. Some other changes as well. It could be made to work, but you'd need to understand that what it says in your pdf and what your character's abilities actually do may be slightly different. If that sounds like it would be annoying, you almost certainly also have the option to play one of any of the other supernatural types in the WoD; Beast is very crossover-friendly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-07T12:26:52-08:00","id":760141,"title":"","content":"Beast is an interesting game, I'd be interested in playing it, I don't really have the time to ST it right now, as I've committed to running other games. But count me interested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1783-spanishinquisition","name":"SpanishInquisition","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1783_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-08T02:52:34-08:00","id":760580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vithrir</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/742875-beast-seeking-a-game?p=757193#post757193\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There are mechanical changes between the kickstarter preview and the backer pdf. For example, the birthright powers for Makara, Namtaru, and Ugallu have all changed from what they are in the preview. The 'You Are Meat' nightmare is gone. Some other changes as well. It could be made to work, but you'd need to understand that what it says in your pdf and what your character's abilities actually do may be slightly different. If that sounds like it would be annoying, you almost certainly also have the option to play one of any of the other supernatural types in the WoD; Beast is very crossover-friendly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the detailed answer, Vithrir. I guess I will wait for the PDF to drop on DTRPG then. And if a Beast game does open up, maybe consider playing another splat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/480-blind-dragon","name":"Blind Dragon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-09T08:00:58-08:00","id":761509,"title":"","content":"I'm still looking for a game here, but I've started up one of my own.<br /> <br /> It's on another site, however.<br /> <br /> **<br /> With the recent release of the Beast pdf to backers I'm looking to start up a game for the monsters to be let loose.<br /> <br /> Set in a slightly fictional Philadelphia, this is a game of territory, of politics and treacherous, shifting alliances. It's also about managing your own little patch of the city and ensuring your hunts and lessons to humanity continue.<br /> <br /> Your Brood will have its own territory and will share the city with the vampire covenants, three werewolf packs and two fellow broods.<br /> <br /> Over it all is the threat of Task Force Valkyrie, which keeps a constant presence in the city.<br /> <br /> You may also want to watch out for the presence of the Union in the neighbourhoods they protect, and the risk of exposure that Network Zero represents.<br /> <br /> But if you want to take the risk, be welcomed to step inside.<br /> <br /> (This game uses the Barony system from Vampire, Damnation City for territory. Don't worry if you don't have it, we'll cover the rules in game.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://rpol.net/game.cgi?gi=65103&amp;date=1447077952\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://rpol.net/images/banner-light.gif\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://rpol.net/game.cgi?gi=65103&amp;date=1447077952\" target=\"_blank\"> I can't find your game! </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://rpol.net/game.cgi?gi=65103&amp;date=1447077952\" target=\"_blank\"> http://rpol.net/game.cgi?gi=65103&amp;date=1447077952 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> RolePlay onLine is a custom made, free web based message board community that anyone can create a game on. It supports internal private messages, groups and multiple aliases, character sheets and descriptions, plus a game map, intro and url. Your email address is kept private and is only used for verification. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-10T15:13:23-08:00","id":762636,"title":"","content":"Sounds good. How do you feel about aircraft? Massive, slowly moving aircraft?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-10T23:44:48-08:00","id":762875,"title":"","content":"Like a blimp?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.t